This directory intentionally holds the vendored MCP `.proto` files
referenced by `../rust/build.rs` and `../../../tools/codegen.sh`.

Until at least one `.proto` file is vendored (see `README.md`), the
Rust crate at `../rust/` will fail to build (`cargo build` reports
"no protos found in `[proto/]`"). This is the documented precondition
for the polyglot scaffold — see `../POLYGLOT-STATUS.md`.
